1
00:00:00,116 --> 00:00:02,956
(Leonard:)I, on the other hand,
feel you should honor your debt.

2
00:00:03,119 --> 00:00:04,579
(Kurt:)You do?

3
00:00:08,124 --> 00:00:10,714
"Feel" is kind of a...
It's a strong word. Uh...

4
00:00:10,877 --> 00:00:13,547
But I just... I think it'd be a nice gesture
on your part.

5
00:00:13,713 --> 00:00:15,793
(Kurt:)She'll get it when she gets it.

6
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:23,096
(Howard:)Well, there you go. Problem solved.

7
00:00:23,598 --> 00:00:27,558
A successful quest. Now let's find
a gas station with a clean bathroom.

8
00:00:28,144 --> 00:00:30,144
(Leonard:)No, the problem isn't solved.

9
00:00:30,313 --> 00:00:31,393
(Leonard:)He just blew us off.

10
00:00:31,564 --> 00:00:33,484
(Sheldon:)I've got it.

11
00:00:33,649 --> 00:00:37,819
(Sheldon:)He didn't remember me, because the last
time we met I was in a Halloween costume.

12
00:00:39,614 --> 00:00:42,494
- Come on, Leonard, let's go.
- No. You can leave if you want to.

13
00:00:42,658 --> 00:00:45,828
(Leonard:)- I'm gonna see this through.
- Okay.

14
00:00:51,375 --> 00:01:00,025
(Leonard:)I guess technically that was my fault.

